# NOTICE

## Project

**WEcoS Product Recommendar** — a suite of five Distributor Lubricant
Engineer (DLE) skills for all the fluid product categories:

1. **lubricant-recommender** — engine oils, gear oils, hydraulic oils,
   compressor oils, turbine oils, refrigeration-compressor oils, PAG,
   ester, and heat-transfer fluids
2. **coolant-recommender** — engine coolants / antifreeze (light-duty,
   heavy-duty diesel, off-highway, marine, stationary, OEM concentrates)
3. **diesel-recommender** — ULSD / EN 590, off-road / mining diesel,
   additized premium diesel, marine distillate fuels (ISO 8217 DMA /
   DMZ / DMB)
4. **adblue-def-recommender** — AdBlue / DEF (Diesel Exhaust Fluid) —
   ISO 22241 AUS 32 urea solution for SCR-equipped diesel
5. **grease-recommender** — industrial, automotive, food-grade (NSF H1),
   marine, mining / heavy-load, electric-motor, refrigeration-compressor,
   central-lubrication, railway-axlebox, and high-temperature greases

The suite is built on top of the MuleRun Fluids Suite prototyping
environment. MuleRun is treated as the prototyping host, not as a
separate copyright or licence layer.

